# The csp/rp2350/csharp sources that the rp2350 build of System.Device.Gpio carries, one path per
# line, relative to that directory: the drivers rp2350.cs constructs from a board's bus table, and the
# bindings and register layouts those drivers take. build-managed compiles them into that build, and
# build-boards leaves them out of each RP2350 board's assembly, which references that build instead,
# so each of these types is in exactly one assembly. The rest of csp/rp2350/csharp is the boards'.
drivers/Rp2350GpioDriver.cs
drivers/Rp2350I2cDriver.cs
drivers/Rp2350SpiDriver.cs
Rp2350ClocksLayout.g.cs
Rp2350I2cBinding.cs
Rp2350I2cLayout.g.cs
Rp2350Instances.g.cs
Rp2350IoBank0Layout.g.cs
Rp2350PadsBank0Layout.g.cs
Rp2350ResetsLayout.g.cs
Rp2350SioLayout.g.cs
Rp2350SpiBinding.cs
Rp2350SpiLayout.g.cs
Rp2350TimerLayout.g.cs
Rp2350XoscLayout.g.cs
